1
00:00:00,690 --> 00:00:03,710
(Sheldon:)By this much.

2
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:05,880
(Leonard:)Tough break.

3
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,000
(Leonard:)You want eggs?

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,770
(Sheldon:)You don't get it, Leonard.

5
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:11,350
(Sheldon:)I'm going to miss so much--

6
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:16,890
(Sheldon:)the unified field theory,
cold fusion, the dogapus.

7
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:18,510
(Leonard:)What's a dogapus?

8
00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:21,700
The hybrid dog and octopus.

9
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,660
(Sheldon:)Man's underwater best friend.

10
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:27,240
(Leonard:)Is somebody
working on that?

11
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:28,520
(Sheldon:)I was going to.

12
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:32,190
(Sheldon:)I planned on giving it to myself
on my 300th birthday.

13
00:00:32,190 --> 00:00:34,240
(Leonard:)Wait a minute.
You hate dogs.

14
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:37,580
(Sheldon:)A dogapus can play fetch
with eight balls.

15
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,260
(Sheldon:)No one can hate that.

16
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:44,340
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

